Cupboard

The token diff behind the code morph
(cupboard/src/commonMain/kotlin/io/github/xxfast/cupboard/document/CodeDiff.kt)
is adapted from storyboard-warp's HeckelDiff.kt by Rahul Ravikumar, licensed
under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  https://github.com/bnorm/storyboard (originally https://github.com/tikurahul/warp)
  https://rahulrav.com/blog/magic_move.html

It implements P. Heckel, "A technique for isolating differences between files",
Comm. ACM 21(4), 264-268 (1978). The changes made are listed at the top of
CodeDiff.kt.
